---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Making Your Own Screwdriver Set - DES4800"
  description="Plan, model, and build a personal screwdriver set for product design studio work."
>
  <article class="post-detail">
    <header class="post-header">
      <a href="/making-your-own-tools/" class="back-link">← Back to Making Your Own Tools</a>
      <h1>Making Your Own Screwdriver Set</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        In this mini-project you will plan, model, and fabricate a screwdriver set you will use in your product design studio work.
        You'll consider handles, storage, materials, and assembly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
